，为之垂涕。亮自临祭，待其遗孤若平生","attribution":"裴注·襄阳记","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":111,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-1cf57332fa3806683c57","start":67,"end":91},{"id":"dongliu-q-8d1ff93eb341f47f1325","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-c007b99c30e3df8ac9f4","layer":"original","quote":"而亮违众拔谡，统大众在前","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":104,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":38,"end":50},{"id":"dongliu-q-968d7586901dfbcd3bb8","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-c007b99c30e3df8ac9f4","layer":"original","quote":"与魏将张郃战于街亭，为郃所破，士卒离散","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":104,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":51,"end":70},{"id":"dongliu-q-a00a88771eb2a3ea4a02","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-a556de01519533b32a10","layer":"original","quote":"先主临薨谓亮曰：“马谡言过其实，不可大用：君其察之","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":103,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":20,"end":45},{"id":"dongliu-q-af18b004074a4ea918de","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-42a72b5bca82dac63101","layer":"pei","quote":"谡临终，与亮书曰","attribution":"裴注·襄阳记","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":111,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-1cf57332fa3806683c57","start":11,"end":19},{"id":"dongliu-q-b26b6a1480b24a0d926b","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-4dd94a3d20bea044e319","layer":"original","quote":"除绵竹、成都令，越嶲太守","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":102,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":19,"end":31},{"id":"dongliu-q-e46cf084367f612679ef","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-4dd94a3d20bea044e319","layer":"original","quote":"以荆州从事随先主入蜀","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":102,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":8,"end":18},{"id":"dongliu-q-e76d9988594e126a9d3e","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-c007b99c30e3df8ac9f4","layer":"original","quote":"谡下狱，物故〖3〗，亮为之流涕","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":104,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":83,"end":98},{"id":"dongliu-q-e9d60a047f9d066765a0","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-c007b99c30e3df8ac9f4","layer":"original","quote":"亮进无所据，退军还汉中","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":104,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":71,"end":82},{"id":"dongliu-q-faa92e13ef0c72c186f9","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-4f59a98859b4f475164b","layer":"pei","quote":"谡对曰：‘南中恃其险远，不服，久矣。虽今日破之，明日复反耳。今公方倾国北伐，以事强贼；彼知官势内虚，其叛亦速。若殄尽遗类，以除后患；既非仁者之情，且又不可仓猝也。夫用兵之道：攻心为上，攻城为下；心战为上，兵战为下：愿公服其心而已","attribution":"裴注·襄阳记","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":110,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-b2f83c142b53ed7a6593","start":47,"end":161},{"id":"dongliu-q2-8583d6122d1fb200f2fe","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-42a72b5bca82dac63101","layer":"pei","quote":"谡临终，与亮书曰：‘明公视谡犹子，谡视明公犹父；愿深惟殛鲧兴禹之议，使平生之交不亏于此：谡虽死，无恨于黄壤也！’","attribution":"裴注（引书见原文）","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":111,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-1cf57332fa3806683c57","start":11,"end":67},{"id":"dongliu-q2-ef77ecc6f2a033036b72","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-a556de01519533b32a10","layer":"original","quote":"才器过人，好论军计；丞相诸葛亮深加器异。先主临薨谓亮曰：“马谡言过其实，不可大用：君其察之！”亮犹谓不然，以谡为参军；每引见谈论，自昼达夜。﹝一﹞","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":103,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":73},{"id":"huangli-q-22924e5717dbac3e7c65","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-c07b80607e4db3042648","layer":"original","quote":"建兴六年，属参军马谡先锋","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":159,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":12},{"id":"huangli-q-5904600ce6ee553f0758","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-c07b80607e4db3042648","layer":"original","quote":"大败于街亭，众尽星散","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":159,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":35,"end":45},{"id":"huangli-q-8f70414a41aba2d4ce93","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-c07b80607e4db3042648","layer":"original","quote":"平连规谏谡，谡不能用","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":159,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":24,"end":34},{"id":"huangli-q-c17dcd424ae69fe98562","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-c07b80607e4db3042648","layer":"original","quote":"丞相亮既诛马谡及将军张休、李盛，夺将军黄袭等兵","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":159,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":93,"end":116},{"id":"huangli-q-cb50c70060b9dbdd4ff9","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-c07b80607e4db3042648","layer":"original","quote":"谡舍水上山，举措烦扰","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":159,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":13,"end":23},{"id":"huangli-q-d93fb00a0e39c932cd7f","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-c07b80607e4db3042648","layer":"original","quote":"于是平徐徐收合诸营遗迸〖1〗，率将士而还","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":159,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":72,"end":92},{"id":"huangli-q-ec683034033dae302667","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-c07b80607e4db3042648","layer":"original","quote":"惟平所领千人，鸣鼓自持。魏将张郃疑其伏兵，不往逼也","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":159,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":46,"end":71},{"id":"huowang-q-48d4d3ad43fe395fd2c9","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-06fb1f2ea118ceeed874","layer":"original","quote":"朗素与马谡善，谡逃亡〖2〗，朗知情不举；亮恨之，免官还成都","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":39,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":11,"end":40},{"id":"jfj-q0131","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-85aae37594d28a751d2e","layer":"original","quote":"建兴六年，丞相诸葛亮军向祁山。时天水太守适出案行〖3〗，维及功曹梁绪、主簿尹赏、主记梁虔等从行〖4〗。太守闻蜀军垂至，而诸县响应；疑维等皆有异心，于是夜亡保上邽〖5〗。维等觉太守去，追迟；至城门，城门已闭，不纳。维等相率还冀，冀亦不入维。维等乃俱诣诸葛亮。会马谡败于街亭，亮拔将西县千余家及维等还，故维遂与母相失。﹝二﹞","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":158,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":160},{"id":"jfj-q0133","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-85aae37594d28a751d2e","layer":"original","quote":"会马谡败于街亭","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":158,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":128,"end":135},{"id":"jfj-q0228","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-1fcbe6e22b07445711e4","layer":"pei","quote":"未及遣迎冀中人，会亮前锋为张郃、费繇等所破","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":173,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-46e2cf216fe32246f7b2","start":192,"end":213},{"id":"mantian-q-f6f8f5fbfa3aab476c3f","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-c03791e69691ce7c6107","layer":"original","quote":"蜀相诸葛亮出祁山；遣将军马谡至街亭〖23〗，高详屯列柳城〖24〗。张郃击谡，淮攻详营；皆破之。又破陇西名羌唐蹄于枹罕〖25〗，加建威将军","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":286,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":5,"end":73},{"id":"mingdi-e-o009b-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-aec45ce1d329ad6dfa62","layer":"original","quote":"蜀大将诸葛亮寇边〖4〗，天水、南安、安定三郡吏民叛应亮〖5〗。﹝二﹞遣大将军曹真都督关右〖6〗，并进兵。右将军张郃击亮于街亭〖7〗，大破之。亮败走，三郡平。丁未〖8〗，行幸长安。﹝三﹞","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":55,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":92},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-76fba510250937628a99","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-76fba510250937628a99","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：太和二年（公元 228）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-38a74578b09178cb1fd4","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"mingdi-q-o008","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-bec9198de0001b0aa26c","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，宣王攻破新城。斩达，传其首〖2〗。﹝一﹞分新城之上庸、武陵、巫县为上庸郡〖3〗，锡县为锡郡。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55},{"id":"mingdi-q-p011","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-c27aa797bbb589ad369a","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《魏略》载帝露布天下并班告益州曰：“刘备背恩，自窜巴蜀；诸葛亮弃父母之国，阿残贼之党：神人被毒，恶积身灭。亮外慕立孤之名，而内贪专擅之实，刘升之兄弟守空城而已。亮又侮易益土，虐用其民；是以利狼、宕渠、高定、青羌莫不瓦解，为亮仇敌。而亮反裘负薪，里尽毛殚；刖趾适屦，刻肌伤骨；反更称说，自以为能；行兵于井底，游步于牛蹄。自朕即位，三边无事。犹哀怜天下数遭兵革，且欲养四海之耆老，长后生之孤幼；先移风于礼乐，次讲武于农隙；置亮画外，未以为虞。而亮怀李熊愚勇之志，不思荆邯度德之戒；驱略吏民，盗利祁山。王师方振，胆破气夺。马谡、高祥，望旗奔败；虎臣逐北，蹈尸涉血。亮也小子，震惊朕师；猛锐踊跃，咸思长驱。朕惟率土莫非王臣，师之所处，荆棘生焉；不欲使千室之邑忠信贞良，与夫淫昏之党共受涂炭。故先开示，以昭国诚；勉思变化，无滞乱邦。巴蜀将吏士民诸为亮所劫迫，公卿以下皆听束手。”","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":84,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-f26a9020083ed68c5298","start":0,"end":387},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o052b-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-6b09c300271ca978ec28","layer":"original","quote":"诸葛亮围祁山，南安、天水、安定三郡反应亮。帝遣真督诸军，军郿；遣张郃击亮将马谡〖12〗，大破之。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":221,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":19,"end":67},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o052","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-6b09c300271ca978ec28","layer":"original","quote":"明帝即位，进封邵陵侯，﹝二﹞迁大将军。诸葛亮围祁山，南安、天水、安定三郡反应亮。帝遣真督诸军，军郿；遣张郃击亮将马谡〖12〗，大破之。安定民杨条等，略吏民保月支城〖13〗，真进军围之。条谓其众曰：“大将军自来，吾愿早降耳！”遂自缚出。三郡皆平。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":221,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":122},{"id":"zhangle-e-o035a-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-1c7bb0c2a4ad2f049b9c","layer":"original","quote":"诸葛亮出祁山。加郃位特进，遣督诸军，拒亮将马谡于街亭。谡依阻南山，不下据城。郃绝其汲道〖2〗，击，大破之。南安、天水、安定郡反，应亮，郃皆破平之。诏曰：“贼亮以巴蜀之众，当虓虎之师〖3〗；将军被坚执锐，所向克定。朕甚嘉之！”益邑千户，并前四千三百户。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":122,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":125},{"id":"zhangle-q-o035","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-1c7bb0c2a4ad2f049b9c","layer":"original","quote":"诸葛亮出祁山。加郃位特进，遣督诸军，拒亮将马谡于街亭。谡依阻南山，不下据城。郃绝其汲道〖2〗，击，大破之。南安、天水、安定郡反，应亮，郃皆破平之。诏曰：“贼亮以巴蜀之众，当虓虎之师〖3〗；将军被坚执锐，所向克定。朕甚嘉之！”益邑千户，并前四千三百户。司马宣王治水军于荆州，欲顺沔入江伐吴；诏郃“督关中诸军，往受节度”，至荆州，会冬水浅，大船不得行，乃还屯方城〖4〗。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":122,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":183},{"id":"zhuge-e-o033a-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-7d68192c0e968e4ac882","layer":"original","quote":"魏明帝西镇长安，命张郃拒亮。亮使马谡督诸军在前，与郃战于街亭〖7〗。谡违亮节度，举动失宜，大为郃所破。亮拔西县千余家〖8〗，还于汉中，﹝三﹞戮谡以谢众〖9〗。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":214,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":79},{"id":"zhuge-q-o033","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-7d68192c0e968e4ac882","layer":"original","quote":"魏明帝西镇长安，命张郃拒亮。亮使马谡督诸军在前，与郃战于街亭〖7〗。谡违亮节度，举动失宜，大为郃所破。亮拔西县千余家〖8〗，还于汉中，﹝三﹞戮谡以谢众〖9〗。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":214,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":79},{"id":"zhuge-q-o034","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-ac0a1291d9674d568ae3","layer":"original","quote":"上疏曰：“臣以弱才，叨窃非据〖10〗，亲秉旄钺以厉三军〖11〗；不能训章明法，临事而惧〖12〗；至有街亭违命之阙，箕谷不戒之失〖13〗。咎皆在臣，授任无方；臣明不知人〖14〗，恤事多暗〖15〗。《春秋》责帅〖16〗，臣职是当〖17〗；请自贬三等，以督厥咎〖18〗。”","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":215,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":133},{"id":"zhuge-q-o034-judgment","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-ac0a1291d9674d568ae3","layer":"original","quote":"上疏曰：“臣以弱才，叨窃非据〖10〗，亲秉旄钺以厉三军〖11〗；不能训章明法，临事而惧〖12〗；至有街亭违命之阙，箕谷不戒之失〖13〗。咎皆在臣，授任无方；臣明不知人〖14〗，恤事多暗〖15〗。《春秋》责帅〖16〗，臣职是当〖17〗；请自贬三等，以督厥咎〖18〗。”","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":215,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":133},{"id":"zhuge-q-o037","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-3f0ba2eacccfab3af07e","layer":"original","quote":"诏策亮曰：“街亭之役，咎由马谡；而君引愆〖23〗，深自贬抑；重违君意〖24〗，听顺所守。前年耀师〖25〗，馘斩王双〖26〗；今岁爰征〖27〗，郭淮遁走；降集氐、羌，兴复二郡；威镇凶暴，功勋显然。方今天下骚扰，元恶未枭；君受大任，干国之重〖28〗，而久自挹损，非所以光扬洪烈矣。今复君丞相，君其勿辞。”﹝五﹞","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":218,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":153}],"profiles":{"mingdi-p0072":{"fields":[],"directory":{"faction":"shu"}}},"directory_counts":{}}
